message: "If you use this research repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: generic
title: "Beyond Matching: OTHERS, Directional Weak-Evidence Scoring, and Reputational Intelligence"
authors:
  - family-names: Tan
    given-names: Sizhe
  - name: GPT-Obot
    affiliation: "AI research collaborator (OpenAI ChatGPT)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sizhet/Beyond-Matching-OTHERS-and-Directional-Weak-Evidence-Intelligence"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-16
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A conceptual and algorithmic research framework for scoring heterogeneous,
  weak, and not-yet-formally-matched evidence. The repository investigates
  directional measurement sails, reputational and collective weak signals,
  perspective-dependent scoring, open structural scoring growth, and evidence
  governance. Version 1.0.0 presents research proposals and validation plans,
  not experimentally established performance claims.
keywords:
  - structural intelligence
  - beyond matching
  - OTHERS
  - weak evidence
  - directional scoring
  - reputational intelligence
  - perspective distance
  - structural growth
  - evidence governance
